<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Submit Recipe - RecipeHub</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Submit a Recipe</h1>
    <form method="POST">
        <label for="title">Recipe Title:</label>
        <input type="text" id="title" name="title" required>
        <br>
        <label for="ingredients">Ingredients:</label>
        <textarea id="ingredients" name="ingredients" required></textarea>
        <br>
        <label for="instructions">Instructions:</label>
        <textarea id="instructions" name="instructions" required></textarea>
        <br>
        <button type="submit">Submit Recipe</button>
    </form>
    <p><a href="/home">Back to Home</a></p>
</body>
</html>
```

*** templates/recipe_browsing.html
```placeholder
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Browse Recipes - RecipeHub</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Browse Recipes</h1>
    <form method="POST">
        <label for="keyword">Search Recipes:</label>
        <input type="text" id="keyword" name="keyword" required>
        <button type="submit">Search</button>
    </form>
    <h2>Recipe List</h2>
    <ul>
        {% for recipe in recipes %}
            <li>{{ recipe.split('|')[0] }} - <a href="/recipe_details/{{ recipe.split('|')[0] }}">{{ recipe.split('|')[0] }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p><a href="/home">Back to Home</a></p>
</body>
</html>
```

